ing non-initialized attributes."}, {"name": "test_schema_human_readable", "description": "Verifies that schemas are human-readable in error messages."}, {"name": "test_type_annotations", "description": "Validates type annotation handling in classes and functions."}, {"name": "test_conditional_set_attr", "description": "Checks that attribute assignment in control flow raises appropriate errors."}, {"name": "test_class_type_as_param", "description": "Tests passing class instances as parameters through scripted functions."}, {"name": "test_out_of_order_methods", "description": "Checks that method order in class definitions does not affect scripting."}, {"name": "test_save_load_with_classes", "description": "Tests serialization and deserialization of classes with attributes."}, {"name": "test_save_load_with_classes_returned", "description": "Tests saving and loading modules returning class instances."}, {"name": "test_save_load_with_classes_nested", "description": "Tests nested class attribute handling in saving/loading workflows."}, {"name": "test_python_interop", "description": "Assesses interoperability between Python classes and TorchScript."}, {"name": "test_class_specialization", "description": "Tests class template specialization within TorchScript."}, {"name": "test_class_sorting", "description": "Validates comparison operators and sorting of class instances."}, {"name": "test_class_inheritance", "description": "Ensures inheritance is disallowed in scripted classes and raises errors."}, {"name": "test_class_inheritance_implicit", "description": "Tests inheritance recognition in implicit scripting situations."}, {"name": "test_imported_classes", "description": "Tests scripting classes imported from external modules."}, {"name": "test_interface", "description": "Checks interface adherence, implementation, and error handling."}, {"name": "test_overloaded_fn", "description": "Tests scripting of classes with operator overloading and special methods."}, {"name": "test